# The plugin comes up with the aeroplane already in the air - a mid-flight
# reload, or the sim started from a saved situation.
#
# It must jump straight to the cruise and it must NOT announce boarding, the
# safety briefing or the after-takeoff PA to passengers who have been sitting
# there for two hours.

library BoardingStarted BoardingWelcome SafetyBriefing AfterTakeoff
library DescentSeatbelts CrewSeatsLanding BeforeLanding AfterLanding

set hour=14 seatbelt=0
set on_ground=0 agl_ft=34000 alt_ft=35000 vs_fpm=0 gs_kt=450 engines=2
advance 30
expect phase CRUISE
expect not-played BoardingStarted
expect not-played BoardingWelcome
expect not-played SafetyBriefing
expect not-played AfterTakeoff

set alt_ft=9000 agl_ft=8500 vs_fpm=-1500
advance 40
expect phase DESCENT
expect played DescentSeatbelts
